The code also includes a logging mechanism to keep track of UE configurations over time (`log_ue_configurations`), memory management functions (`free_network`), and helper functions for determining priority levels based on signal strength (`determine_priority`) and generating random UE properties within specified ranges (`randomize`). The network can be set to dynamically adjust UE configurations based on real-time updates from an external system by setting the `dynamic` parameter in `initialize_network`.']

