The function scales efficiently as the number of concurrent sessions increases, optimizing for both throughput (concurrency) and latency (fast locking/unlocking). The code also handles edge cases like zero or exceeded size `N`, and provides a fallback strategy to prevent system failure by returning NULL when the list is full.

