The allocateUE() function handles potential overflow scenarios gracefully by resizing the array if necessary while maintaining the integrity of the data already present. The getUnassignedRNTI() function validates that each RNTI is unique within the array and logs any failures during the validation process.

The logResourceUsage() function provides a mechanism to monitor and report on memory usage, which can be logged periodically or triggered by specific events.']

