The code is optimized for performance by minimizing resource usage and ensuring high availability through dynamic updates. However, it makes trade-offs between efficiency, usability, and scalability, as the update interval is set to every minute for simplicity. This solution can be further optimized by implementing more efficient data merging techniques or reducing the update interval based on network latency and other factors.

