The resource pool is thread-safe and supports efficient frequent reallocations with minimal memory overhead. It also logs resource utilization statistics periodically using an external logging framework. The maximum size of the resource pool can be configured by setting the `MAX_UE_COUNT` constant, and developers may need to adjust this value based on their specific system requirements.']

